<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Nagelmackers in fund deal with UK Schroder.</title>
<headline>Belgian Nagelmackers in fund deal with UK Schroder.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian  Banque Nagelmackers said on Wednesday it reached an agreement with U.K. firm Schroeder Investment Management Ltd to distribute a number of Schroder investment funds operating under Luxembourg law.</p>
<p>Schroder Investment Management is a unit of Schroders Plc.</p>
<p>Banque Nagelmackers is part of Belgian bancassurance group P&amp;V.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
